INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (1, '3-reasons-for-choosing-only-a-paediatric-physiotherapist-for-your-child', '3 Reasons for Choosing only a Paediatric Physiotherapist for Your Child', 'If your child is receiving some type of treatment, it may be required to see a physiotherapist. If it is a treatment of an orthopedic condition, the doctor can almost always recommend physiotherapy. Even in other illnesses, the side effects can affect your child’s mobility. If you are seeking physio', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="900" height="602" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Child-Physiotherapy-11.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="3 Reasons for Choosing only a Pediatric Physiotherapist for Your Child" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Child-Physiotherapy-11.jpg 900w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Child-Physiotherapy-11-300x201.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Child-Physiotherapy-11-768x514.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>If your child is receiving some type of treatment, it may be required to see a physiotherapist. If it is a treatment of an orthopedic condition, the doctor can almost always recommend physiotherapy. Even in other illnesses, the side effects can affect your child’s mobility. If you are seeking <strong><a href="../../paediatric-physiotherapy.html">physiotherapy for child in noida</a></strong>, it is important to choose a pediatric physiotherapist.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Benefits of Choosing a Physiotherapist</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>There are many benefits of choosing a pediatric therapist. Whether it is a therapist for providing <strong><a href="../../back-pain.html">physiotherapy for back pain in noida</a></strong> or for any other condition, there are many reasons to choose a specialist.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">1. Specialized Rehab for Children</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>When you choose a pediatric physiotherapist, you are choosing a specialist for treating your child’s condition. They know how to engage a child for optimal benefits of the therapy. This can help speed up the recovery process. They can create exercise regimes that include more play.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">2. Children Need Special Care</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Children have tender bones, joints, and muscles that require special care. Choosing pediatric <strong>physiotherapy for back pain in noida</strong>, limbs, or other body parts means that the expert knows about taking care with the growth plates. They can also identify any potential damage to such parts and ensure proper and timely treatment.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">3. Proper Treatment &amp; Fewer Visits</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>When it comes to your child, it is crucial to get proper treatment the first time. This will reduce or eliminate any risks of re-injury. This means that your kid will be able to get back to normal activities in a shorterperiod of time. Besides, preventing re-injuries can also reduce the costs of treatment.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A pediatric specialist does much more than provide <strong>physiotherapy for child in noida</strong>. They also provide the perfect environment for your child’s recovery. They have better understanding of the issues children can suffer from and how to treat them.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (2, '4-symptoms-that-require-you-to-see-the-physiotherapist-in-noida', '4 Symptoms that Require You to See the Physiotherapist in Noida', 'The most common reason people seek physiotherapy is to get relief from pain that may have been bothering them for some time. Such pain can also limit mobility. The pain may be because of injury, poor posture or other reasons. If you are suffering from such a pain, you should see the physiotherapist ', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="460" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Four-symptoms.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="4 Symptoms that Require You to See the Physiotherapist" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Four-symptoms.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Four-symptoms-300x141.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Four-symptoms-768x360.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>The most common reason people seek physiotherapy is to get relief from pain that may have been bothering them for some time. Such pain can also limit mobility. The pain may be because of injury, poor posture or other reasons. If you are suffering from such a pain, you should see the <strong>physiotherapist in Noida</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">When to See a Physiotherapist?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>There are many different reasons you may need to see a physiotherapist. If you suffer from the following issues, you should seek <strong>physiotherapy in Noida</strong>:</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">1. Regular Pain</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are suffering from consistent pain of whatever intensity, you should see a therapist. If you have severe pain that lasts 3 days or more, you should not take it lightly.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">2. Loss of Balance</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are suffering from loss of balance, you should again seek <strong><a href="../../index.htm">physiotherapy in Noida</a></strong>. This can be due to problems with the inner ear. Your physiotherapist can help treat the condition with vestibular rehab. This involves creation of an exercise program involving the head, eyes, and neck to adapt the central nervous system.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">3. Different Movement</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you feel that you are moving differently after your injury, you should visit a physiotherapy clinic. If you are not sure about it, ask someone else to see you walking or moving.If often occurs that you may feel different since your injury and it may not be easy to identify what it is. You should not try to ignore it like most other people.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">4. Pain Associated with Movement</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If a certain movement causes pain, you should seek treatment. The pain may be associated with walking, bending, or reaching out. You may have to avoid that movement to avoid the pain. It is best to get an evaluation to identify the cause of the problem instead of trying to avoid the movement.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So, you should see the <a href="../../index.htm"><strong>best physiotherapist in Noida</strong> </a>if you notice any of the symptoms mentioned above.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (3, '4-tips-for-finding-the-best-physiotherapy-clinic-in-noida', '4 Tips for Finding the Best Physiotherapy Clinic in Noida', 'People suffer from different types of injuries every now and then. Then there are progressive conditions like arthritis that can make life difficult. Physiotherapy can be part of your rehab plan that helps you heal and recover from an injury. Whatever the need for this therapy, it is important to ch', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="542" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Tips-for-Finding-the-Best-Physiotherapy-Clinic.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Tips for Finding the Best Physiotherapy Clinic" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Tips-for-Finding-the-Best-Physiotherapy-Clinic.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Tips-for-Finding-the-Best-Physiotherapy-Clinic-300x166.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Tips-for-Finding-the-Best-Physiotherapy-Clinic-768x424.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>People suffer from different types of injuries every now and then. Then there are progressive conditions like arthritis that can make life difficult. Physiotherapy can be part of your rehab plan that helps you heal and recover from an injury. Whatever the need for this therapy, it is important to choose the <strong>best physiotherapy clinic in noida</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So how do you choose the perfect clinicto receive effective therapy?</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. Choose a Registered Physiotherapist</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Not every physiotherapy clinic is going to be run by registered physiotherapists. Only the few <strong>best physiotherapy centre in Noida</strong> will have licensed therapist who are trained and registered. A licensed therapist will do a complete assessment before beginning your therapy. Only such a clinic can ensure faster recovery and prevention of injuries.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. Location &amp; Price Should Not be the Priorities</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Many people choose a physiotherapy clinic based on location and price. Just because a therapist is located close-by and is affordable, it doesn’t mean that they are perfect for your rehab and treatment. Convenience doesn’t always translate into excellent care. You should check for licensing and the facilities provided by the centre before making the right choice.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. Initial Consultation</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You should have an initial consultation with the therapist where they elaborate on your treatment or rehab program. You should clarify all your expectations before the therapy begins. This will help ensure that you will get results that you already expected from the beginning. Besides, if you are not satisfied with the information provided by the physio during the consultation, you can look for <strong>best physiotherapy clinic in noida</strong> elsewhere.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. Rehab Duration</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You should know that physiotherapy is a long-term rehab process. It is going to take some time before your condition can improve. Again, you should discuss this detail during the initialconsultation. This should give you an expected time for your condition to improve to the desired levels.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So consider all these points when looking for the <strong>best physiotherapy center in noida</strong>.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (4, '6-top-qualities-in-selecting-the-best-physiotherapist-around-you', '6 Top Qualities in Selecting the Best Physiotherapist around You', 'Physiotherapists play an important role in taking care of patients’ ailments with extreme patience and providing intensive treatment. In this article, we will look at some of the best qualities in choosing the best physiotherapist near you. Physiotherapists help restore, maintain and promote the bes', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="660" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Best-Physiotherapist-around-You.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Best Physiotherapist around You" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Best-Physiotherapist-around-You.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Best-Physiotherapist-around-You-300x202.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Best-Physiotherapist-around-You-768x516.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>Physiotherapists play an important role in taking care of patients’ ailments with extreme patience and providing intensive treatment. In this article, we will look at some of the best qualities in choosing the best physiotherapist near you. Physiotherapists help restore, maintain and promote the best possible physical health of their patients, extensively.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>#1: Knowledgeable</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Staying in line with the latest trends and updating knowledge is another important factor that physiotherapists should keep in mind. Knowledge sources are pervasive and plentiful, and a successful physiotherapist will always update their knowledge with the latest trends and implement them as best practices, to treat patients with unique methods of treatment.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>#2: Humble</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>A physiotherapist along with being realistic should also maintain humbleness. Your physiotherapist should be an extremely extrovert person who can gain knowledge from peers, recollect their best practices and from patients. Later, gaining through experience and applying the best treatment to patients prove the humbleness of your physiotherapist.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>#3: Astute</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Observation is something a physiotherapist should have as the first quality. Anyone can see pain as just pain over the muscle, but only a physical therapist can look into the ailment deep down. Being astute is one of the prominent qualities of the best physiotherapist which can lead to proper treatment.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>#4: Patient-focused</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Your physiotherapist should ensure a patient-centric approach and appreciate patients for keeping up patience in waiting to see them and availing treatment. Even under circumstances where patients become impatient with their pain sufferings and commonplace problems.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>#5: Positive</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>A physiotherapist should throw some positive words on patients and motivate them that their pains and sufferings are going to be no more, and very soon, they will get back to normal. This will give some hope to them and make them stay strong till treatment.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>#6: Intelligible</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Your physiotherapist knows what happens with your health and how to treat it, but as a patient, you may have concerns with respect to treatment and attaining satisfaction. Make sure your physiotherapist bridges the gap between you and them, in order to make the treatment effective and continuous, so as a patient, you claim extreme benefit in all aspects.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>With these high-end qualities, you can understand how to select the best physiotherapist, and which&nbsp;<strong><a href="../../index.htm" title="best physiotherapy centre in Noida">best physiotherapy centre in Noida</a>&nbsp;</strong>has the top-class physiotherapist. If you need guidance on choosing the best physical therapist, type the&nbsp;<strong><a href="../../doctor-neelam-sharma.html" title="best physiotherapist near me&nbsp;">best physiotherapist near me&nbsp;</a></strong>on Google and you can reach the website of K.R Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic, one of the greatest physical therapists in Noida, India.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (5, 'back-pain-causes-and-cure', 'Back Pain: Causes and Cure', 'Back pain is a common type that most of the individuals experience at least once or twice in their lifetime. But before the situation goes worst and requires a surgical treatment of the same, physical therapy is the common solution to the same. Depending on how severe the case is, therapy is decided', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="905" height="600" src="../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Back-Pain-Causes-and-Cure.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Back Pain Causes and Cure" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Back-Pain-Causes-and-Cure.jpg 905w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Back-Pain-Causes-and-Cure-300x199.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Back-Pain-Causes-and-Cure-768x509.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 905px) 100vw, 905px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>Back pain is a common type that most of the individuals experience at least once or twice in their lifetime. But before the situation goes worst and requires a surgical treatment of the same, physical therapy is the common solution to the same. Depending on how severe the case is, therapy is decided on weekly sessions. Initially, the therapy starts with four weeks of sessions that help in reducing the pain and eventually increasing the function of the lower back.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What Causes Back Pain?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Back Pain is categorized into three different segments:</p>\n\n\n\n<ol class="wp-block-list" type="1">\n<li><strong>Specific Spinal Pathologies</strong>: Under this category, back pain is caused by the spinal infections, malignancy, spinal fractures as well as caudal equine syndrome. Under this category, urgent treatment is highly recommended.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Radicular Syndrome</strong>: This category includes injuries such as:</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Slipped disc</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Spondylolisthesis</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Degenerative disc disease</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Back ligament sprain</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Facet joint sprain</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>And many more</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Under this category of back pain, the nerve either gets irritated or compressed under some conditions. In this category, surgical and medication treatment is preferred.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Non-Specific Lower Back Pain</strong>: This is one of the most common categories where the injury occurs because of no particular injury in the structure. Causes can be limitless. People can relate to some of the coon causes like:</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sitting in a single posture for hours</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lifting heavy loads on their back</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Poor posture</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stressing your lower back while you sleep</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>And many more</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this category, early recovery and in fact prevention measurement is easily detectable. If you feel that you follow a schedule that includes the mentioned postures for most of your day, then you might require early diagnosis of lower back pain. You can look for<strong> <a href="../../back-pain.html">back pain clinic in Noida</a></strong>, who are specialized therapist with availability of advance tools and measurements.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Types of Physical Therapies</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Paralysis physiotherapy in Noida</strong> follows the common and most successful modules of therapy which includes:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Passive Physical Therapy</strong>: Under this category, therapy includes common procedural needs like heat application, electrical stimulation and ice packs.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Active Physical Therapy</strong>: Under this session, therapist focus on specific stretching sessions and exercises that helps in reducing the pain from the lower back of the patient.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Back Pain can lead to severe issues that affect the patient physical as well as mentally. The emotions are deeply affected too as people lose the active confidence in themselves. And this, proper active and passive treatment of back pain is highly recommended in order to improve the quality of physical health as well as life.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (6, 'beat-the-muscle-pain-with-kr-physiotherapy-rehabilitation-clinic', 'Beat the muscle pain with KR physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Clinic', 'To get rid of my muscle pain, I tried many best physiotherapists in Noida. Nothing could beat the services of KR Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Clinic. KR Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Clinic is a highly qualified physiotherapy clinic nearby sector 53 Noida. The professional doctors treated my pain', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="900" height="600" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/muscle-pain-1.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Beat the muscle pain with KR physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/muscle-pain-1.jpg 900w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/muscle-pain-1-300x200.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/muscle-pain-1-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>To get rid of my muscle pain, I tried many&nbsp;best physiotherapists in Noida. Nothing could beat the services of KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic. KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic is a highly qualified&nbsp;<strong><a href="../../physiotherapy-in-noida-sector-53.html">physiotherapy clinic nearby sector 53 Noida</a></strong>. The professional doctors treated my pain with such expertise like the pain never existed before.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>I had prolonged joint pain, and I tried getting rid of pain with exercises. The pain disrupted my day-to-day activities. When I heard about the professional services of KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic- the&nbsp;<strong><a href="../../index.htm">best physiotherapist in Noida</a></strong>, I did not wait for a second to visit the clinic. The clinic is situated at a convenient location and is one of the&nbsp;physiotherapy clinics nearby sector 53 Noida.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>When I visited the clinic, the doctors heard me out and understand the pain thoroughly. Unlike many other clinics, they did not keep me wait for hours to get diagnosed. The clinic’s staff is so professional and has great technologies. They have enough equipment to handle the bundle of patients. The healing process of my joint was such a smooth process with KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>I had an injury in my joint while playing sports but when I began the process of healing with KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic- the&nbsp;<strong>best Physiotherapist in Noida</strong>; I got to know that they provide physiotherapy services to everyone. From paediatric to elderly they provide physiotherapists to all age groups. The experts of the clinic not only heal the pain but also make sure that it never reoccurs again. After my treatment, not once; I had felt muscle pain in my joint.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>The best thing about this clinic is the way they keep a personal touch with clients. I had my healing treatment process almost 5 months ago; still, To the day I receive text messages from them- asking about my pain and checking on me if I am following the home exercises they suggested or not. I beat my muscle pain with KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic and I keep on referring my friends/family to visit the same for any kind of muscle pain. Say goodbye to muscle pain forever with KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (7, 'cupping-therapy-and-the-various-advantages-it-provides', 'Cupping therapy and the various advantages it provides', 'There is absolutely no doubt in the world that one of the worst things that you can ever suffer from is a pain in the body parts. It can be any area in the body and the pain is one thing that is the most unwanted existence in it. No matter whatever the situation is people must absolutely understand ', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="576" src="../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cupping-therapy.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Cupping therapy and the various advantages it provides" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cupping-therapy.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cupping-therapy-300x176.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cupping-therapy-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>There is absolutely no doubt in the world that one of the worst things that you can ever suffer from is a pain in the body parts. It can be any area in the body and the pain is one thing that is the most unwanted existence in it. No matter whatever the situation is people must absolutely understand that there are and n number of different types of techniques that can help you deal with the same.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Of course one of the best techniques that can help you is the cupping therapy. This therapy is one ancient therapy and has been just resurfaced. It is simply because of the fact that the benefits and many. You must understand for the best advantages finding the best services of <strong><a href="../../hijama-cupping-therapy.html">Cupping Therapy in Noida</a></strong>, is certainly important.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Advantages of the cupping therapy</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Following are the various advantages that you can get out of using the cupping therapy for yourself:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Helps with pain:</strong> A body can always have pain in certain parts. After all in today’s time getting enough rest is not one of an option for you! This is exactly when the cupping therapy can come into a great help. You can come across good <strong><a href="../../index.htm">pain management clinic in noida</a></strong> that helps you with the back pain with the help of cupping therapy.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Helps with blood flow:</strong> This is one particular therapy that can be extremely advantages for a body because it helps in a regular blood flow in it. Many times the body becomes a bit colder and therefore the blood flows slows in it. This can be really dangerous for the body in various ways. With the cupping therapy things can be great as the blood flow will become normal again.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Helps with inflammation:</strong> There are certain parts of the body that can always face the issue of inflammation. This can also be painful at times and it is absolutely why you must undertake the help of cupping therapy. It can make sure that you do not have to face the problem of inflammation anymore at all.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>There are of course many other benefits of the cupping therapy. But nothing can beat the importance and the necessity of the advantages mentioned above.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (8, 'everything-that-you-need-to-know-about-ligament-injury', 'Everything That You Need To Know About Ligament Injury', 'Sports injuries don’t really need an introduction to anyone as they are known to the common in every type of sports possible. Whether you are a cricket person or a basketball player; sports injuries are nothing new to you. Speaking of the same, one of the most common sports injuries is knee ligament', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="900" height="595" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/acl-injury.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Knee Ligament Injury" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/acl-injury.jpg 900w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/acl-injury-300x198.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/acl-injury-768x508.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>Sports injuries don’t really need an introduction to anyone as they are known to the common in every type of sports possible. Whether you are a cricket person or a basketball player; sports injuries are nothing new to you. Speaking of the same, one of the most common sports injuries is knee ligament. Let’s understand the same in detail.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What is Knee Ligament?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Knee ligament is a condition which occurs because of tough fibrousness in the connective tissues. These tissues are generally composed of molecules which are long and stringy collagen. The ligament can be treated as a situation where one bone is connected to the other bone which is around the joint which means it does not connect to the muscles. The ligament reduces the mobility of the joint which prevents proper movement of the knee as a whole.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What Causes Knee Ligament Injury?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>When you will browse for a session of <strong><a href="../../knee-ligament-injury.html">physiotherapy for ligament injury in Noida</a></strong>, the therapist will generally ask you on the act which caused the ligament in your knee. In general, the ligament is a condition which appears when:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>There is a sudden sharp change in the direction&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The landing of the knee is not correct because of a sudden jump</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Blunt forcing hitting the knee, including football tackle</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Ligament generally occurs when the mentioned actions are approaching in speed and tear the muscle to go weak. Weak muscles will eventually invite sprain or tear of ligament.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Speaking of healing time of injuries related to knee, foot and ankle, it will entirely depend on what type of treatment you sign for. Depending on the degree or grade of injury<strong>, <a href="../../index.htm">KR Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Clinic</a> </strong>will offer you common treatment such as:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Early Injury Treatment</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gait Analysis</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Medications</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Soft Tissue Massage</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Yoga</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Heat Packs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Join Mobilization Techniques</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Biomechanical Analysis</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Acupuncture sessions</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dry Needling</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Closed Kinetic Chain Exercises</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Brace or Support</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strength and Stretching Exercises</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strapping</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Supportive Taping</li>\n\n\n\n<li>TENS Machine</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Video Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Noida, in particular, is considered as a region where one can find specialized physiotherapist for every need type. They are well versed with clinical advancement in the methodologies included in quick recovery of sports injuries. From ACL Injury to LCL sprain, ligament treatment is conducted under the latest tools and machines advancement for a sportsman to get back in the field as quick as possible. They relate to the passion of the sportsmanship and thus, work in order to push them back in their respective fields.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (9, 'everything-you-need-to-know-about-physiotherapy', 'Everything You Need To Know About Physiotherapy', 'Are you suffering from chronic pain? It’s commonplace to be afflicted with discomfort and aches, particularly when you get older or suffer from a sporting injury, or are suffering from an ongoing illness. Have you thought about visiting a physical therapist? Continue reading to learn how physiothera', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="655" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Everything-You-Need-To-Know-About-Physiotherapy.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Everything You Need To Know About Physiotherapy" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Everything-You-Need-To-Know-About-Physiotherapy.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Everything-You-Need-To-Know-About-Physiotherapy-300x200.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Everything-You-Need-To-Know-About-Physiotherapy-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>Are you suffering from chronic pain? It’s commonplace to be afflicted with discomfort and aches, particularly when you get older or suffer from a sporting injury, or are suffering from an ongoing illness. Have you thought about visiting a physical therapist? Continue reading to learn how physiotherapists can be considered to be the human body’s mechanics — and how the <strong>physiotherapy</strong> process can help you feel at your most at your</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><strong>What is Physiotherapy?</strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Simply put, physiotherapy could be described as a therapeutic technique that is based on the latest research-based and non-invasive physical methods to ease discomfort while also encouraging the maintenance and restoration of health and well-being.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are four primary reasons that physiotherapy is one of the most effective treatments </p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>&nbsp;Physiotherapy helps in quick and effective recovery of your body</li>\n\n\n\n<li>&nbsp;Physiotherapy enhances your lifestyle</li>\n\n\n\n<li>&nbsp;Physiotherapy can treat a wide range of health conditions</li>\n\n\n\n<li>&nbsp;Physiotherapy allows you to become more active.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Through a variety of treatments, like massage cupping, exercise or stretching techniques, physiotherapists aid patients treat physical pain that is caused by injury, illness or other conditions, as well as ageing.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Who is a physiotherapist?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Health professionals who offer physical therapy are referred to as physiotherapists, physical therapists and physios. A physiotherapist, also known as a “physical therapist” (PT) is a highly-trained health professional who provides treatment to patients suffering from physical issues that result from illnesses, injuries and age.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A physiotherapist’s goal is to implement an integrative approach to health that will enhance the health of patients by utilizing a variety of treatments that can improve function and ease discomfort. When it comes to rehabilitation for someone suffering from a disease the aim is to decrease physical impairment and enhance their quality of life.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Why do people visit a physical therapist?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>In many instances, an injury that you visit a <strong><a href="../../index.htm">physiotherapist in Noida</a></strong> for may be caused by other factors that are underlying. It is possible that your back pain is due to working at a desk or being overweight, or simply not warming up prior to exercises at the gym. Therefore, a physiotherapist doesn’t just treat back pain, but will also address other issues as well.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Based on your age, your doctor might recommend that you consult a <strong><a href="../../index.htm">physiotherapist in Delhi</a></strong>. They can aid in maintaining a healthy and healthy aging by allowing people to continue working and remain active throughout the length of time they can. The holistic and whole-body method that physiotherapists employ is designed to minimize the chance of injury occurring over and over.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Physical therapy can assist in the management of chronic medical conditions like arthritis, aid in healing injuries that occur suddenly, provide an athlete the edge at the event of sports or assist women in preparation to give birth.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A physiotherapist helps a patient move their arm</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Physiotherapy aids athletes in recovering from sports-related injuries and surgeries with a variety of different methods, such as cupping or massage.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What exactly does a physical therapist do?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Physiotherapists (PTs) perform things differently every day according to the patients they treat and if they’ve an area of expertise. A PT could be required to examine the physical health of a patient in order to identify issues and develop an appropriate treatment program. They may also be training patients to walk, or helping others with the use of walking frames, crutches or wheelchairs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The most common conditions that require physiotherapy are:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Sports injuries</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rehabilitation after surgery</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Accidents at work</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Joint sprains</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Muscle is stretched</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Headaches</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lower back discomfort</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Neck pain</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Vertigo</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Plantar fasciitis</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tendinosis</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Different kinds of physiotherapy treatments</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Physical therapists are able to employ a variety of treatment methods they can employ in their work with patients. Based on the reason why you’re practicing physiotherapy treatments, you could be able to use any of the following methods:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Functional training</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stretching</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Massage</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dry needling</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cupping</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strategies for self-management</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Taping</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Joint mobilization</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lifestyle advice</li>\n</ul>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (10, 'feel-the-relief-from-the-functional-disorder-with-kr-physiotherapy-rehabilitation-clinic', 'Feel the Relief from the functional disorder with KR Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Clinic', 'When I say KR Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Clinic is the best neuro physiotherapist in Noida ; I know I am saying on behalf of many patients like me. The healing process of the functional disorder is as similar as recovering from a major illness. The healing requires extra care and extra support.', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="902" height="656" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/functional-disorder.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="functional disorder" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/functional-disorder.jpg 902w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/functional-disorder-300x218.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/08/functional-disorder-768x559.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 902px) 100vw, 902px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>When I say KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic is the&nbsp;<strong><a href="../../neurological-physiotherapy.html">best neuro physiotherapist in Noida</a></strong> ; I know I am saying on behalf of many patients like me. The healing process of the functional disorder is as similar as recovering from a major illness. The healing requires extra care and extra support.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>I had a spinal cord injury; one of my friends suggested me to visit KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic, and I did so. My injury was taken care of by Neurological experts. I received extra care and specialized treatment with specialized equipment. What caught my attention the most in the clinic was the way, <strong>Dr. Neelam Sharma</strong> was treating the patient sitting next to me. The patient sitting next to me had brain injuries and needed additional support.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Neelam Sharma took care of the patient with delicate care and attention. She is one of the best&nbsp;<strong><a href="../../doctor-neelam-sharma.html">Female Physiotherapists in Noida</a></strong>. I was observing the way all the experts of KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic were treating their assigned patients. The treatment that all patients received was mesmerizing as I have never seen any clinic taking so good care of their patients.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The clinic has not only expert staff but also has a modern environment. KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic is one of the rarest neuro physiotherapists in Noida because of the modern medicine and modern equipment to heal patients. The presence of Neelam Sharma- the best&nbsp;<strong>Female Physiotherapist in Noida</strong>, also makes the clinic shine even more.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Before getting treatment from KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic, I tried some other clinics which made such a big deal of my Spinal Cord injury, and rather than treating my pain, those clinics blame me for not taking care of my spine. With KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic’s Neurological service I had the experience of the healing process with additional support and extravagance care.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Bottom Line</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Neelam Sharma is a highly professional expert who knows her field and is indeed the best&nbsp;<strong>Female Physiotherapist in Noida</strong>. She has earned her name because of the treatment she provides to her patients. I never wish that anyone of you ever has to visit neurological experts, but God forbade it happens; then you must visit KR Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation Clinic to feel the relief from the functional disorder.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (11, 'go-for-the-cupping-therapy-in-noida-for-best-results', 'Go For The Cupping Therapy In Noida For Best Results', 'Cupping therapy has been used for thousands of years, from the time of the Chinese, Egyptian, and ancient Middle East countries, as a part of medical treatment which is used to treat muscle pain, inflammation, regulate blood flow and even relax the tissues of our body. Cupping therapy delivers resul', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="984" height="587" src="../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Go-For-The-Cupping-Therapy-In-Noida-For-Best-Results.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Go For The Cupping Therapy In Noida For Best Results" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Go-For-The-Cupping-Therapy-In-Noida-For-Best-Results.jpg 984w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Go-For-The-Cupping-Therapy-In-Noida-For-Best-Results-300x179.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Go-For-The-Cupping-Therapy-In-Noida-For-Best-Results-768x458.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 984px) 100vw, 984px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>Cupping therapy has been used for thousands of years, from the time of the Chinese, Egyptian, and ancient Middle East countries, as a part of medical treatment which is used to treat muscle pain, inflammation, regulate blood flow and even relax the tissues of our body. Cupping therapy delivers results which are very relaxing and comforting. We all love a fit, and fine body and cupping therapy help you to maintain your fitness and health.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What Happens In This Therapy?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>In a cupping therapy, your therapist will put an easily flammable substance such as alcohol, or paper in a cup and set it on fire. He or she will then put the cup in an upside down position on your skin as the fire goes out. As the air trapped inside the cup cools, it helps to create a vacuum. This vacuum causes your skin to rise and redden as the blood vessels are expanded. The cups are usually left in place for up to 3-5 minutes and then taken out. Thus now you will get a much better and refreshed set of body muscles.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Benefits Of Cupping Therapy</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Cupping therapy is used to treat many different problems among the people. The benefits of this therapy are numerous. The therapy helps in the relaxation of your muscles. It brings local pain relief for longer periods of time. Cupping therapy increases the overall blood flow to the whole body thus increasing your metabolism. The therapy is a very important treatment for paralysis and helps the muscles and ligaments to move once again. Therefore, many people get amazing benefits by treating themselves with this therapy.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The<strong> <a href="../../hijama-cupping-therapy.html">Cupping therapy in Noida</a></strong> is very popular and widely available therapy, with health centers waiting to help you out and give you a great experience. So if you are in Noida and are burdened with stress and daily activities or facing any muscular problems, you can always choose to treat yourself with the cupping therapy and deliver your body a great relaxation time which will refresh and regulate it once again.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (12, 'how-can-you-benefit-from-musculoskeletal-physiotherapy', 'How Can You Benefit from Musculoskeletal Physiotherapy?', 'If you or a loved one has some musculoskeletal disorder, your doctor can recommend you to see the best physiotherapy centre in Noida. Musculoskeletal physiotherapy works as part of the treatment process for such disorders. This therapy helps patients recover faster. It also provides you with coping ', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="544" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Musculoskeletal-Physiotherapy.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="How Can You Benefit from Musculoskeletal Physiotherapy" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Musculoskeletal-Physiotherapy.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Musculoskeletal-Physiotherapy-300x166.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Musculoskeletal-Physiotherapy-768x425.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>If you or a loved one has some musculoskeletal disorder, your doctor can recommend you to see the <strong><a href="../../index.htm">best physiotherapy centre in Noida</a></strong>. Musculoskeletal physiotherapy works as part of the treatment process for such disorders. This therapy helps patients recover faster. It also provides you with coping methods for recovery and preventing other issues.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Types of Musculoskeletal Disorders</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Musculoskeletal issues can be of the muscle, joint, ligament, and/or nerve. Specialized <strong><a href="../../index.htm" title="">physiotherapist in Noida</a></strong> is available for treatment and improvement of the following common conditions:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Chronic back pain or acute back pain with disc issues and sciatica</li><li>Headaches</li><li>Elbow or wrist pain</li><li><a href="../../neck-pain.html">Neck pain</a>, whiplash, or <a href="../../shoulder-pain.html">shoulder pain</a></li><li>Ankle, knee, or hip pain</li><li>Post-trauma injuries or fractures</li><li>Post spinal surgery pain</li><li>Repeating strain inquires</li><li>Post orthopaedic surgeries</li><li>Sports injuries, soft tissue injuries, strains or sprains</li><li>Paediatric musculoskeletal and orthopaedic conditions</li><li>Sacroiliac joint pain</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p>There are many more conditions that can be treated by KR Physiotherapy Rehabilitation Clinic Noida that <a>s</a><a href="../../musculoskeletal-physiotherapy.html">pecializes in musculoskeletal therapy</a><a>.</a></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Benefits of Musculoskeletal Physiotherapy</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><a href="../../musculoskeletal-physiotherapy.html">Musculoskeletal <strong>physiotherapy in Noida</strong></a><strong> </strong>can help you recover and improve your quality of life. Some of the main benefits of this therapy are as follows:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Improved muscular flexibility and strength</li><li>Improved and easier range of motion</li><li>Relief from pain</li><li>Improved control and coordination</li><li>Reduced inflammation and swelling</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p>This type of therapy can help develop coping strategies so that you can handle the pain and challenges to normal movements. You will learn healthier and safer ways of movement. This further reduces the chances of developing secondary disorders. Even after your therapy sessions are over, your therapist at the <strong><a href="../../index.htm">physiotherapy clinic in Noida</a></strong> can develop a programme that you can follow at home.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thus, musculoskeletal therapy offers many benefits. You should choose the <strong><a href="../../index.htm">best physiotherapy centre in Noida</a></strong> for your therapy and recovery. You will eventually start feeling more independent and self-sufficient after completing the sessions.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (13, 'how-does-physiotherapy-help-with-knee-pain', 'How Does Physiotherapy Help with Knee Pain?', 'Knee pain is one of the most common pains people suffer from. In many cases it is associated with one or other forms of arthritis, which causes gradual decline in the mobility of the joint. However, there are other causes of knee pain that may be fully treatable. Physiotherapy is an integral part of', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="576" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/How-Does-Physiotherapy-Help-with-Knee-Pain.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="How Does Physiotherapy Help with Knee Pain?" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/How-Does-Physiotherapy-Help-with-Knee-Pain.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/How-Does-Physiotherapy-Help-with-Knee-Pain-300x176.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/How-Does-Physiotherapy-Help-with-Knee-Pain-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>Knee pain is one of the most common pains people suffer from. In many cases it is associated with one or other forms of arthritis, which causes gradual decline in the mobility of the joint. However, there are other causes of knee pain that may be fully treatable. Physiotherapy is an integral part of the treatment program in almost all kinds of knee pains. Find out when you should seek therapy in a <strong>physiotherapy clinic near by sector 53 noida</strong> and how the therapy can help you.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Symptoms of Knee Pain</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You should consider seeing specialist at a <strong>physiotherapy clinic near by sector 50 noida</strong> if you experience the following pains or issues:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Stiffness and swelling</li><li>Sharp and shooting pain when using the knee</li><li>Unable to bend or straighten your knees</li><li>Popping sound when getting up or sitting</li><li>Weakness in the knees</li><li>Knee pain that appears when resting or sleeping</li><li>Development of deformity around your knee</li><li>Knee pain that may last for many days</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Benefits of Physiotherapy</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Once your orthopedic doctor recommends physical therapy, you should visit a good <strong>physiotherapy clinic near by sector 34 noida</strong>. The therapy can help in improving the joint mobility and strength. It can also improve your balance.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Some of the therapies provided for treating knee pain can include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Stretching</li><li>Balance training</li><li>Muscle strengthening</li><li>Joint stabilization</li><li>Joint mobilization</li><li>Gait training</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The therapist in your <strong>physiotherapy clinic near by sector 53 noida</strong> may use electrical stimulation, ultrasound, heat and ice treatment, and athletic taping to improve the pain and the underlying cause. You may get recommendations on the use of orthotics, braces, or assistive devices.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The therapies used for treating your knee pain are going to depend on the severity of your condition. The <strong>physiotherapy clinic near by sector 50 noida</strong> will work to provide optimal mobility and flexibility to your knee while reducing the pain. Besides, the therapist will also teach you how to manage and strengthen the muscles around the joint when you are at home or after the completion of the treatment.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (14, 'how-much-does-physiotherapy-cost-in-noida-and-delhi', 'How much does physiotherapy cost in Noida and Delhi?', 'The practice of physiotherapy can address physical disabilities, illnesses injuries and other health issues by performing physical exercises massages, and other. Through Physiotherapy treatment, you are able to prevent surgery and even stop completely the use of medication. It is not only efficient ', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="900" height="600" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/How-much-does-physiotherapy-cost-in-Noida-and-Delhi.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="How much does physiotherapy cost in Noida and Delhi?" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/How-much-does-physiotherapy-cost-in-Noida-and-Delhi.jpg 900w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/How-much-does-physiotherapy-cost-in-Noida-and-Delhi-300x200.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/How-much-does-physiotherapy-cost-in-Noida-and-Delhi-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>The practice of physiotherapy can address physical disabilities, illnesses injuries and other health issues by performing physical exercises massages, and other. Through Physiotherapy treatment, you are able to prevent surgery and even stop completely the use of medication. It is not only efficient but also cost-effective when compared with other therapies available. They are well-trained and highly experienced professionals who can assist you with chronic illnesses. The most beneficial aspect of this therapy is that you can take advantage of physiotherapy at home. It can be used in a variety of treatment and areas such as the acupuncture method, hand treatment, massage therapy occupational health, neurology infants, senior adults, children as well as sports.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What are the major benefits of Physiotherapy in Delhi and Noida?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are numerous benefits of doing physiotherapy at home, especially in cities like Delhi and Noida which is known for its polluted levels and poor traffic conditions. Delhi and Noida are both cities with a huge geographical area, so traveling long distances can be challenging. All these factors put a person under increased health risk especially if the person is suffering from any kind of injury or health condition and so it is better to avoid commuting and have a physiotherapist/medic come visit you on house call.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The most significant benefit of having physiotherapy at home Delhi and Noida is the absence of a travel. When traveling, one runs the danger of aggravating an injury. When you have a professional to visit you at home, you are able to unwind and recuperate at home.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Another benefit of this new era therapy for Delhi and Noida is that, unlike previous visits to physiotherapists in which you had to adhere to the schedule of the physiotherapists it now gives you the option of choosing the day and time of your physiotherapist’s appointment according to your time and your lifestyle.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Physiotherapy in Delhi and Noida</strong> is also economical when compared to regular sessions with a <strong>physiotherapist</strong> as there is no commute required. Another advantage of having a physiotherapist at your home is that they will be able observe your surroundings including your workplace, and could possibly offer suggestions for adjustments to posture and exercises that could be performed at the comfort of your home in order to help speed recovery.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What can you expect from KR Physiotherapy in Delhi and Noida?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>The initial session for physiotherapy is dedicated to conducting a physical assessment, diagnosing and setting the rehabilitation goals and then formulating a comprehensive treatment plan that is individualized to the lifestyle of the patient.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The physical exam is extensive, encompassing biomechanical assessments, postural analysis and strength tests to establish an assessment. Based on the diagnosis the physiotherapist and the patient set an exercise goal. Following this, a suitable treatment plan is formulated to speed up the recuperation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What are the various types of Physiotherapy Services We Offer?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Physiotherapy is a broad field that deals with a variety of ailments like knee pain, Parkinson’s Disease, post surgery rehabilitation, post and pre pregnancy treatment, and so on. To ensure that you receive the highest quality home physiotherapy services within Delhi, KR Physiotherapy offers the most skilled professional <strong>physiotherapists from Delhi and Noida</strong> who specialize in different areas of physiotherapy you can pick from. The various types of physiotherapy available at KR Physiotherapy are:</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Musculoskeletal Physiotherapy:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>The physiotherapy field is mostly concerned with dealing with injuries that affect the joints, muscles, and soft tissues such as back pain, knee neck discomfort, cervical pain Tennis elbow, sciatica etc.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pediatric Physiotherapy:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>The physiotherapy field primarily addresses children, babies and teens. The physiotherapists who specialize in paediatric physiotherapy assists children and babies with neurological problems such as sensory disorders, cerebral palsy as well as developmental and growth issues to mention just a few.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Geriatric Physiotherapy:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>This specialized area of physiotherapy is mostly concerned with ailments and injuries that affect older adults. Geriatric physiotherapy can go far in maintaining the physical and mental health of people who are elderly.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>And others such as:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Sports Therapy</strong></li><li><strong>Women’s health physiotherapy</strong></li><li><strong>Neurological Physical Therapy</strong></li><li><strong>Incontinence</strong></li><li><strong>Palliative and cancer care as well as lymphedema</strong></li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>How Can I Get Physiotherapy At Your Home in Delhi or Noida?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Finding a top physiotherapist visiting you at home is now easy and simple because of KR Physiotherapy at your home in Delhi. All you have to do is call KR a phone call and a renowned physiotherapist from Delhi and Noida will be in your residence. You can also book an appointment on our website, where you have to enter your information and our representative will respond to you.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Cost of Physiotherapy in Delhi and Noida</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Cost of physiotherapy in Delhi and Noida</strong> are a bit varying as the final price will depend on various variables such as the duration of treatment, the number of sessions needed, the nature of the physiotherapy and the method used and the seriousness of the patient’s issue. However, physiotherapy at home in Delhi is still fairly economical, affordable and economical.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Cost of physiotherapy in Delhi starts at Rs.700 per session.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (15, 'how-to-choose-the-best-physiotherapy-clinic-in-noida', 'How to Choose the Best Physiotherapy Clinic in Noida?', 'If your treatment or recovery requires you to undergophysiotherapy, your doctor is going to suggest it. It can be quite difficult to determine the best physiotherapy clinic in noida for effective and timely recovery. You will have to consider a number of things before you can determine if a clinic i', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="460" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Best-physiotherapy-doctors-in-panathur-bangalore.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="How to Choose the Best Physiotherapy Clinic in Noida?" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Best-physiotherapy-doctors-in-panathur-bangalore.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Best-physiotherapy-doctors-in-panathur-bangalore-300x141.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Best-physiotherapy-doctors-in-panathur-bangalore-768x360.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>If your treatment or recovery requires you to undergophysiotherapy, your doctor is going to suggest it. It can be quite difficult to determine the <strong>best physiotherapy clinic in noida</strong> for effective and timely recovery. You will have to consider a number of things before you can determine if a clinic is perfect for you or not.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. Registered Therapists</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You may find many centers offering physio services. Instead, you should choose the <strong>best physiotherapy center in noida</strong> that has a registered therapist. Even before the treatment process begins, it is important that a licensed therapist does an assessment. This is important not just for effective treatment, but also to prevent any injuries during treatment.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A registered physiotherapist means:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>A university degree from a reputed institution</li><li>Passing the national board examination</li><li>Membership of Indian Association of Physiotherapists</li><li>Maintaining a good standing</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. Convenient Business Hours</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The right clinic will be open at hours that are convenient to you. For example, some of the <strong>best physiotherapy clinics in noida are</strong> open for early morning and late evening sessions. This can allow you to take appointments before or after work. Many people are unable to receive proper physiotherapy because of work or other commitments.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. Dedicated Services</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Choose a center that ensures that you will receive the services directly from the physiotherapist. Avoid a facility that has a team of assistants who are not registered physiotherapists. It is best to receive treatment from the licensed specialist. There should be no compromise on this point.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. Professional Clinic Environment</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The <strong>best physiotherapy center in noida</strong>will have the perfect environment to provide the therapies. Consider the following factors in this regard:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Are there private therapy rooms?</li><li>Do they have a gym with all the equipment required for therapies?</li><li>Do you find the place interesting?</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Physiotherapy involves many appointments that can last for several weeks. So you will want to ensure that the center provides an excellent and engaging environment for your therapy.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So consider all these factors when looking for the perfect physiotherapy facility for your treatment.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (16, 'how-to-keep-your-child-engaged-in-their-physiotherapy-treatment', 'How to Keep Your Child Engaged in their Physiotherapy Treatment', 'Does your child have back pain? He or she may be having some other orthopedic pain and may be in need of physiotherapy as part of the treatment. Whatever the underlying cause that requires such therapy, you should find a specialist in physiotherapy for child in noida.', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="576" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/child-physiotherapy-blog.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="If you are a woman, you should know that there are both physiological and physical differences between men and women. So women need special physiotherapy in different conditions and at different ages. If you or a loved one are having certain physical problems, you should be careful when choosing the best physiotherapist in noida for women’s health. BasicPhysical Differences If you are thinking about looking for a Female Physiotherapist in Noida, you should know about the following physical differences between men and women: • Women have lesser muscle mass than men • Women usually have greater proportion of body fat. Most of this fat is stored in specific body parts. • Men usually have more body hair. Benefits of Physiotherapy for Women There is lots of evidence about the benefits of physiotherapy in alleviating or curing symptoms of incontinence, pelvic pain, prolapse, constipation, and other conditions in women. Some of areas where the best physiotherapist in noida can help you include the following: • Relief from lower back pain • Activation of pelvic floor • Relief from pelvic and hip pain around pregnancy • Reduction in lymphatic swelling • Strengthening core • Control of urinary incontinence Treating Hypotonic Pelvic Floor Muscles Studies show that structured exercise regimen can strengthen the pelvic floor muscles and reverse many symptoms of hypotonic pelvic floor muscles. Some of the treatment methods used in physiotherapy include: • Pelvic floor exercises for re-training • Pilates based exercises to improve pelvic stability • Use of pelvic floor muscle stimulators for improving pelvic floor contraction Your Female Physiotherapist in Noida can include many therapies into your treatment program. This can include trigger point release, scar massage, neural mobilizations, myofascial stretches, relaxation techniques, and more. Your therapist can also provide you advice on positional and toileting modifications depending on your health problem. Thus, there are many reasons why women’s health conditions often require a therapist who specializes in the area." decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/child-physiotherapy-blog.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/child-physiotherapy-blog-300x176.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/child-physiotherapy-blog-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>Does your child have back pain? He or she may be having some other orthopedic pain and may be in need of physiotherapy as part of the treatment. Whatever the underlying cause that requires such therapy, you should find a specialist in <strong>physiotherapy for child in noida</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Getting your child interested in the therapy and focusing on recovery can be a challenge for you as a parent. It is recommended to follow these tips to help your child focus on feel more interested in their <strong><a href="../../back-pain.html" title="physiotherapy for back pain in noida">physiotherapy for back pain in noida</a></strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">For Children 3 to 5 Years Old</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>This is an age group when children are able to follow commands. They still cannot understand the benefits of such a therapy.You can explain the exercises to be part of play time. Check with the therapist if playing equipment can be used to get your child doing physio without realizing what it is.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">For Children 6 to 12 Years Old</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If your child is aged 6 to 12, he or she is already used to following instructions. Kids in this age group can engage in more structured activities. This means it will be easier for you to get your child to have <strong>physiotherapy for back pain in noida</strong>. You can ask your kid to do exercises that can be done by adults as well.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>At the same time, you should keep in mind that such exercises can become tedious. This makes it important to make such sess<a></a>ionsfun and short. If you struggle with it, your therapist can help in suggesting alternative exercises to improve your kid’s condition.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You may also participate in the exercises with your child. This can make the sessions more fun. Still, you should follow the simple principle of encouragement to keep your child engaged in the program.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So make sure to keep these tips in mind when it comes to <strong><a href="../../paediatric-physiotherapy.html" title="physiotherapy for child in noida">physiotherapy for child in noida</a></strong>. The right strategy can play a big role in ensuring your child feels great while getting proper treatment.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (17, 'muscular-pain-consult-a-physiotherapist', 'Muscular Pain? Consult A Physiotherapist', 'In Pain after our Mom, only person who can help us to get relieved from this muscular pain is a Physiotherapist. Back ache, shoulder pain, sensation in some parts while moving has been very common due to our busy scheduled lives. Many of us end up using the pain balms to stop the pain. This', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="576" src="../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Muscular-Pain-Consult-A-Physiotherapist.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Muscular Pain? Consult A Physiotherapist" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Muscular-Pain-Consult-A-Physiotherapist.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Muscular-Pain-Consult-A-Physiotherapist-300x176.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Muscular-Pain-Consult-A-Physiotherapist-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p>In Pain after our Mom, only person who can help us to get relieved from this muscular pain is a Physiotherapist. Back ache, shoulder pain, sensation in some parts while moving has been very common due to our busy scheduled lives. Many of us end up using the pain balms to stop the pain. This is where we should STOP.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>How it occurs</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Muscular Pain happens for a reason. When your shoulder pains and you can’t move a bit of it also might result you in dislocation of it.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Back Ache does sometime occur when you sit for 9hrs continuously at your office, but continue pain might results in some serious injury internally.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Physiotherapists are healthcare professionals who will treat your medical condition accordingly by giving you physical exercises. There are many Experienced and high reviewed <strong><a href="../../index.htm">Physiotherapist in Noida</a>. </strong>You can visit them in their chambers or can also request them a home visit for the exercise treatment.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Cost and time period</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Physiotherapy treatment does not cost you very expensive. It starts from Rs 250/- to 1500/- per sessions dependin<a></a>g on your medical condition.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Every individual is different from one another. Hence healing capability differs from person to person. Some might progress it in 3 to 5days and some treatment might go up to 20 sessions. This also depends in one’s medical condition.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Clinic of <strong><a href="../../index.htm">Physiotherapy in Noida</a></strong> provides treatment for all the muscular pains and diagnoses the treatments with required equipment’s for physical exercises for Elbow pain, hand muscles, Knee pain, Lower back ache, Muscle cramps, Shin splints, shoulder pain, Upper back and wrist pain. You get specialised treatments for these medical conditions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Physiotherapist have deep knowledge of the complete musculoskeletal system which includes about 840 muscles between 206 and 270 bones 220 nerves and lot more. You got to have faith on your Therapist and follow his/her guidance to get relieved from this unavoidable pain.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Massage therapy works easily and fast if you feel the symptom in the early stage and act fast by consulting a Physiotherapist. Don’t delay and avoid any muscular pain to live a relaxing and pain relieved life.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (18, 'physiotherapy-a-lifeline-for-a-quality-life-ahead', 'Physiotherapy: A Lifeline For A Quality Life Ahead', 'What do you do when the mobility or functionality of your body is disturbed? Or let me put it this way: What do you do when your knee takes a sharp turn in the direction while you are playing football? The answer is Physiotherapy. You will look for a physiotherapist in your region to help you improv', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="542" src="../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Physiotherapy-A-Lifeline-For-A-Quality-Life-Ahead.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Physiotherapy - A Lifeline For A Quality Life Ahead" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Physiotherapy-A-Lifeline-For-A-Quality-Life-Ahead.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Physiotherapy-A-Lifeline-For-A-Quality-Life-Ahead-300x166.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Physiotherapy-A-Lifeline-For-A-Quality-Life-Ahead-768x424.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>What do you do when the mobility or functionality of your body is disturbed? Or let me put it this way: What do you do when your knee takes a sharp turn in the direction while you are playing football? The answer is Physiotherapy. You will look for a physiotherapist in your region to help you improve quality of life and reduce your muscle or joint pain.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Different Segments of Physiotherapy</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Physiotherapy is considered as an allied profession in the medical industry that uses the following modules in order to attain better health quality of the patient:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Mechanical force</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Exercise therapy</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Remediates impairments</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Electrotherapy</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Mechanical force and movements</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>And if you are looking for a <strong>physiotherapist in Noida</strong>, some of the common services that you must look out for are as follows:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Acute sport injury services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Acupuncture</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bike Fit</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dietitian services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Exercise physiologist</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pilates</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Massage</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>When it comes to the knowledge regarding the body, the entire structure of physiotherapy is divided into different specialty areas. Depending on the condition of the patient and which body part requires physiotherapy treatment, they can avail services of <strong><a href="../../index.htm">physiotherapy in Noida</a></strong> under the following specific areas:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Clinical Electrophysiology</strong>: Therapist in this area are specialized in electrotherapy, wound management, and electrophysiological evaluation.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Geriatric</strong>: <a href="../../geriatric-physiotherapy.html">Geriatric therapists</a> are concerned which patients with the following mobility limitation:\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Arthritis</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Alzheimer’s disease</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Osteoporosis</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cancer</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Balance disorders</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Incontinenc</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Joint and hip replacement</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Integumentary</strong>: This area includes conditions related to wounds and burns</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Neurological</strong>: This area includes mobility dis-functionality because of neurological disease or disorder.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Orthopedic</strong>: This area is concerned with treatment related to injuries of the musculoskeletal system.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Pediatric:</strong> This area is concerned with pediatric population and diagnosing the modalities or disorders in the inhabitants with growing age.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Sports</strong>: This area is concerned with athletes and speculation of their sports injuries</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Back Pain treatment</strong>: This area is concerned with severe back pain and treatments related to the same.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The mentioned information will help you categorize your mobility limitation in a specific area of functionality. Physiotherapy treatment is required at least once at a stage where patients realize abnormality in their mobility. Noida, in particular, is a roof to a specialized therapist to aid you with permanent treatments.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (19, 'points-to-get-best-paralysis-physiotherapy-in-noida', 'Points to Get Best Paralysis Physiotherapy in Noida', 'Doesn’t matter whether you a male or female, this information is for all. While considering statistics, a lot of individuals have decided to get physiotherapy treatments to get relief from old muscle pains. But, if an individual suffers from a paralysis, then physiotherapy is one among the best trea', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="912" height="577" src="../wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Points-to-Get-Best-Paralysis-Physiotherapy-in-Noida.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Points to Get Best Paralysis Physiotherapy in Noida" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Points-to-Get-Best-Paralysis-Physiotherapy-in-Noida.jpg 912w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Points-to-Get-Best-Paralysis-Physiotherapy-in-Noida-300x190.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Points-to-Get-Best-Paralysis-Physiotherapy-in-Noida-768x486.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 912px) 100vw, 912px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>Doesn’t matter whether you a male or female, this information is for all. While considering statistics, a lot of individuals have decided to get physiotherapy treatments to get relief from old muscle pains. But, if an individual suffers from a paralysis, then physiotherapy is one among the best treatment that helps to over paralysis up to a greater extent. If you are the one among those individuals who are suffering from a paralysis and want to get treatment from the best <strong>paralysis physiotherapy in Noida</strong>, then you need to keep certain things in your mind before attempting a physiotherapy treatment.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A paralysis physiotherapy treatment includes various aspects that an individual need to be aware of to avoid confusion originated at the time of result observation. Following are a few aspects which help you to have a nice experience in the same.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>First of all, your prime concern is to choose a physiotherapy clinic carefully in which you are willing to have your paralysis treatment.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ask about the physiotherapist’s experience in treating paralysis patients. Experience is often a crucial factor in achieving positive outcomes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ensure that the physiotherapists at the chosen clinic are qualified and licensed to practice. They should have experience in treating paralysis and related conditions.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Research the reputation of the physiotherapy clinic by reading online reviews and asking for recommendations from healthcare professionals, friends, or family members. A clinic with a good track record is more likely to provide quality care.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Visit the clinic or rehabilitation center to assess their facilities and equipment. Ensure that they have the necessary tools and technology to provide effective paralysis physiotherapy.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Research the reputation of the physiotherapy clinic by reading online reviews and asking for recommendations from healthcare professionals, friends, or family members. A clinic with a good track record is more likely to provide quality care.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gain an understanding of the treatment techniques and approaches the clinic uses. Effective paralysis physiotherapy may include techniques like neuro rehabilitation, gait training, and functional electrical stimulation.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Inquire about the cost of each session and whether the clinic offers any payment plans or discounts for multiple sessions. Clear communication about fees is essential to avoid surprises.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Next thing that is to be kept in consideration is the qualification of your doctors and their personality. It helps in building a trust factor if you found your physiotherapists listens to you carefully. &nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>You must know that paralysis physiotherapy procedures come together with various after treatment precautions. Thus, you need to select the desired process for obtaining best paralysis physiotherapy results.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Consider the location and accessibility of the clinic. It should be convenient for the patient and their caregivers to attend regular physiotherapy sessions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>KR Physiotherapy, <strong><a href="../../index.htm" title="best Physiotherapy Clinic in Noida">best Physiotherapy Clinic in Noida</a> </strong>has served thousands of people with paralysis physiotherapy to treat them. In case you are willing to avail services offered by KR Physiotherapy, then visit the website once for solving your related concerns.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It is one among the renowned clinics proving best <strong>paralysis physiotherapy in Noida</strong>, which also provides top treatments for back pain, neck pain, and other muscle pain. With an objective of bestowing help to all paralytic patients, our physiotherapists are always present at our clinic at <strong>Physiotherapy Clinic in Sector 51 Noida. </strong>So, you can reach us anytime to get the best treatment at affordable prices.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (20, 'solve-all-joint-pains-with-the-help-of-physiotherapy-in-noida', 'Solve all Joint Pains with the Help of Physiotherapy in Noida', 'There is nothing worse than suffering from joint pains like knee pain and lower back pain for a long time. One of the easiest and best ways to treat diseases like this is to use physiotherapy. There are numerous physiotherapists in Noida who are well experienced in that field and are capable of heal', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="576" src="../wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Joint-pain.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Solve all Joint Pains with the Help of Physiotherapy in Noida" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Joint-pain.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Joint-pain-300x176.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Joint-pain-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>There is nothing worse than suffering from joint pains like knee pain and lower back pain for a long time. One of the easiest and best ways to treat diseases like this is to use physiotherapy. There are numerous physiotherapists in Noida who are well experienced in that field and are capable of healing the joint pain in no time. It is always better to opt for physiotherapy sessions rather than surgeries, as the process is easier and involves no pain. Also, it is cheap, everyone can afford it.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you reside in Noida, then you should definitely look up for clinics that do <strong><a href="../../index.htm">physiotherapy in Noida</a></strong>. The process is really simple. First, the doctors observe the problem. The symptoms are noted down like redness or swelling of the region, instability in the joints, etc. then individual attention is given to the parts as physiotherapy treatment is done to relieve the body part of the pain. With regular sessions, it helps to heal the affected region, and all the swelling gets reduced soon.&nbsp; Under the guidance of the <strong><a href="../../index.htm">physiotherapist in Noida</a></strong>, regular exercises are given to the affected part can do movement again. Thus the ligaments gradually get healed as patients can again move the body parts easily.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Common Causes of Joint Pain</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p>There are various causes of Joint pain, and it can affect people of all ages. Understanding the common causes of joint pain is crucial for proper diagnosis and treatment. Here are some common reasons for joint pain.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Osteoarthritis</strong>: Osteoarthritis is a common degenerative joint disorder characterized by the breakdown of cartilage, the tissue that cushions the ends of bones within a joint. As the cartilage wears away, bones can rub against each other, leading to pain, stiffness, and reduced joint mobility.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Rheumatoid Arthritis</strong>: Rheumatoid arthritis and osteoarthritis are inflammatory conditions affecting the joints. Rheumatoid arthritis involves the immune system mistakenly attacking the joints, causing inflammation. Osteoarthritis results from wear and tear on the joints over time, leading to pain and stiffness.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Gout</strong>: This specific type of arthritis results from the accumulation of uric acid crystals in the joints, often affecting the big toe.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Joint Overuse or Strain</strong>: Excessive or repetitive use of a joint, especially during physical activities or sports, can cause strain and lead to joint pain. This is common in weight-bearing joints like the knees and hips.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Injuries and Trauma</strong>: Joint injuries are also a common reason for joint pain if not treated properly.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Infectious Arthritis</strong>: Infectious arthritis, also known as septic arthritis, is a serious condition characterized by the invasion of a joint by bacteria, viruses, or fungi.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Tendonitis</strong>: Inflammation of tendons, which are the tissues that connect muscles to bones.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Ligament Injuries</strong>: Injuries to the ligaments, can lead to joint instability and pain. Anterior Cruciate Ligament (ACL) injuries is an example of this type of injuries.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Joint Hypermobility</strong>: Joint hypermobility refers to the ability of joints to move beyond the normal range of motion. Joint Hypermobility is also a cause of Joint Pain.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Hormonal Changes</strong>: Hormonal fluctuations, such as those during menopause, can contribute to joint pain in some individuals.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>How Physiotherapy helps to relieve the Joint Pain</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p>It is better to get physiotherapy sessions and move freely rather than doing the restricted movement for your entire life. Physiotherapy helps individuals improve their physical function and mobility. Here are several ways in which physiotherapy can contribute to relieving joint pain:</p>\n\n\n\n<h6 class="wp-block-heading"></h6>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pain Management Techniques</strong>: Physiotherapists employ various pain management techniques, including manual therapy, massage, and modalities such as heat or cold therapy. These methods help reduce pain and inflammation, providing relief to individuals experiencing joint pain.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Exercise Prescription</strong>: Physiotherapists design customized exercise programs to target specific joints and surrounding muscles. These exercises help improve strength, flexibility, and range of motion, which can alleviate joint pain. Strengthening the muscles around a joint provides better support and stability.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Joint Mobilization and Manipulation</strong>: Physiotherapists use hands-on techniques to mobilize or manipulate joints. This can help improve joint function, reduce stiffness, and alleviate pain. It’s essential for the physiotherapist to assess the individual’s condition and tailor these techniques accordingly.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Education and Self-Management</strong>: Physiotherapists educate patients about their condition, teaching them about proper body mechanics, posture, and ergonomics. Understanding how to move and perform daily activities correctly can prevent further joint stress and reduce pain.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Modalities</strong>: Various modalities such as ultrasound, electrical stimulation, and laser therapy may be used in physiotherapy to reduce inflammation, promote healing, and manage pain. These modalities can complement other treatment strategies.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Weight Management</strong>: Physiotherapists often provide advice on weight management, as excess weight can put additional stress on joints, exacerbating pain. Achieving and maintaining a healthy weight can contribute to long-term joint health.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Assistive Devices</strong>: Physiotherapists may recommend assistive devices such as braces, splints, or orthotics to provide support and reduce strain on affected joints. These devices can be useful in managing joint pain and improving function.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Patient-Specific Rehabilitation Programs</strong>: Physiotherapy focuses on individualized care. Physiotherapists assess the patient’s specific needs, taking into account their medical history, lifestyle, and goals. This personalized approach is crucial for an effective rehabilitation program.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thus if you are a resident of Noida, then you should definitely consider getting a physiotherapy treatment done to lead a better life, minus all the pain. Walk easily, run and play, all after one treatment.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (21, 'what-are-the-3-most-common-causes-of-hand-pain', 'What are the 3 Most Common Causes of Hand Pain?', 'Many people suffer from hand pain due to various reasons. Despite the pain, many of them continue to live with the pain without concern what may be the underlying cause. It is only when the pain becomes unbearable that they seek medical help. Usually, when you have an injury you are more likely to v', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="540" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/What-are-the-3-Most-Common-Causes-of-Hand-Pain.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="What are the 3 Most Common Causes of Hand Pain" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/What-are-the-3-Most-Common-Causes-of-Hand-Pain.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/What-are-the-3-Most-Common-Causes-of-Hand-Pain-300x165.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/What-are-the-3-Most-Common-Causes-of-Hand-Pain-768x422.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<h1 class="wp-block-heading"></h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Many people suffer from hand pain due to various reasons. Despite the pain, many of them continue to live with the pain without concern what may be the underlying cause. It is only when the pain becomes unbearable that they seek medical help. Usually, when you have an injury you are more likely to visit a <strong>Joint pain treatment clinic in Noida</strong>. If the pain is mild, most people continue suffering without trying to get to the root of the problem.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here you will find a list of the common causes behind hand pain and why it is important to visit a <strong><a href="../../index.htm">Physiotherapy clinic in Noida</a></strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. Carpal Tunnel Syndrome</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>This type of hand pain is caused due to nerve disorders in the hand. The pain usually lurks on a few fingers or the palm, wrist, or on the forearm. Usually, the pain gets worse during nighttime. This condition can also cause other problems like numbness, tingling sensation, and weakness. The index finger, middle finger and the thumb are the most commonly affected fingers. If you have such pain, you should immediately visit a good <strong><a href="../../index.htm">Physiotherapy clinic in Noida</a></strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. Arthritis</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Arthritis is the most common cause of hand pain. There are different types of arthritis, but the common problem among all types is that the cartilage in the joints gradually deteriorates and causes pain and swelling. It can occur on different joints in the hand and you shouldn’t let it lurk for long. It will be best to go to a <strong><a href="../../index.htm">Joint pain treatment clinic in Noida</a></strong> during the early phase of this condition.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Arthritis in the hand can affect different joints including the following:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>The thumb’s base</li><li>The end joint on the finger</li><li>Middle joint on the finger</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. Injury to the Hand or Wrist</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You may be suffering from hand pain due to a minor or major injury. Many times people injure their wrists due to a minor fall or while exercising and ignore the mild pain. If you leave such injuries unattended, they can turn into major issues in the long term. If you notice any pain after a fall or accident, you should have your hand checked at a <strong>Physiotherapy clinic in Noida</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Flexor tendon injuries are common and involve the long connective tissue responsible for connecting the finger bones with the forearm muscles. These injuries may not be as painful in the beginning, but if left unattended they can turn into bigger issues in the future. A severe injury can also prevent the connected finger from moving. The common injuries causing hand pain are caused due to falls, sports injuries, or cuts. You may also suffer flexor tendon injuries if you already have rheumatoid injuries.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So whatever the underlying cause, you should get all kinds of hand pain checked at a good <strong><a href="../../index.htm">Joint pain treatment clinic in Noida</a></strong>. Most people suffer from one or the other kind of hand pain, but quash it as a minor issue. You should never take any pain in your hands lightly and see a specialist to prevent any complications.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (22, 'what-are-the-benefits-of-a-female-physiotherapist-for-you', 'What are the Benefits of a Female Physiotherapist for You?', 'As a woman, you are at a higher risk of back pain than men. Similarly, there are many other areas where you can face higher chances of pain in your body. If you are suffering from some type of bodily pain, you should not just visit any physiotherapy center, but a clinic with a Female Physiotherapist', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="576" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/What-are-the-Benefits-of-a-Female-Physiotherapist-for-You.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="What are the Benefits of a Female Physiotherapist for You" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/What-are-the-Benefits-of-a-Female-Physiotherapist-for-You.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/What-are-the-Benefits-of-a-Female-Physiotherapist-for-You-300x176.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/What-are-the-Benefits-of-a-Female-Physiotherapist-for-You-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>As a woman, you are at a higher risk of back pain than men. Similarly, there are many other areas where you can face higher chances of pain in your body. If you are suffering from some type of bodily pain, you should not just visit any physiotherapy center, but a clinic with a <strong>Female Physiotherapist</strong>. While there are many advantages of visiting a therapist who is a female, you should know about the various conditions when you may require their services.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This can help you better understand why it makes more sense to find the <strong><a href="../../doctor-neelam-sharma.html">female physiotherapist in Noida</a> </strong>from your own gender.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Physiotherapy Requirements</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You may need to see a physiotherapist for a wide range of conditions, including the following:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Osteoporosis</strong>: Physiotherapy helps in stopping the further loss of bone. It also lowers any risk of bone fractures. The therapy can focus on strengthening exercises.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Pregnancy</strong>: Almost everyone goes through the problem of back pain during pregnancy. YourPhysiotherapistcan help you find relief from a wide range of pain and problems during this period. This includes pain in the pelvic area, thoracic area and ribs, neck pain, fitness, headaches, leg cramps, and more.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Endometriosis</strong>: You can benefit from physiotherapy both before and after your surgery. It can especially be valuable when you suffer from musculoskeletal issues. Some of the key treatment methodologies can include lengthening pelvic floor muscle, myofascial manual therapy, flexibility and stretching exercises, trigger point release and more.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Obesity: </strong>Obesity is a chronic disease in which excess body weight increases the risk of many diseases. These diseases include high blood pressure, diabetes, depression, and some cancers. Physiotherapists treat pain and movement problems. They assist you in guiding physical activities to reduce obesity. Post-pregnancy, it is common for females to gain their weight. In such a situation, a female physiotherapist understands a female’s problems better.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>There are many other areas where the <strong><a href="../../index.htm">best physiotherapist in Noida</a></strong> can help you. This includes premenstrual syndrome, chronic pain conditions, depression, and obviously recovering from injuries. Finding a female therapist can always make a huge difference in your recovery and the benefits you may receive. The mental benefits will themselves make a huge difference.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (24, 'what-are-the-benefits-of-neurological-physiotherapy', 'What are the Benefits of Neurological Physiotherapy?', 'Neurological conditions are usually believed to affect the elderly. However, they can also affect younger people. A neuro physiotherapist in Noida can help in treating such conditions that cause functional and movement disorders. These disorders are caused because of impairments that affect the nerv', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="983" height="540" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/07/What-are-the-Benefits-of-Neurological-Physiotherapy.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="What are the Benefits of Neurological Physiotherapy" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/07/What-are-the-Benefits-of-Neurological-Physiotherapy.jpg 983w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/07/What-are-the-Benefits-of-Neurological-Physiotherapy-300x165.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/07/What-are-the-Benefits-of-Neurological-Physiotherapy-768x422.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 983px) 100vw, 983px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>Neurological conditions are usually believed to affect the elderly. However, they can also affect younger people. A <strong><a href="../../neurological-physiotherapy.html">neuro physiotherapist in Noida</a></strong> can help in treating such conditions that cause functional and movement disorders. These disorders are caused because of impairments that affect the nervous system, spinal cord, or the brain.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">How Can Neurological Physiotherapy Help?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>A <strong>neuro physiotherapist in Noida</strong> can help in initiating messaging pathways that the brain may have issues in using. The therapist uses therapies and activities that help the CNS to create new pathways. These activities typically include repetitive exercises and actions. The kinds of symptoms that can be improved after these visits include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Loss of balance</li><li>Difficulties with leg/foot function</li><li>Loss of hand/arm function</li><li>Difficulties with walking</li><li>Problems with spasticity</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Patients with neurological conditions can struggle with many more issues. This can include muscle weakness, loss of range of motion, loss of function, loss or reduction of balance, and reduction in stamina. The therapies can also help in treating neurological conditions involving pain.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Neurological Conditions</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Some of the common neurological conditions that may require treatment from a Neuro <strong><a href="../../doctor-neelam-sharma.html">Female Physiotherapist in Noida</a></strong> include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Stroke</li><li>Spinal cord injuries</li><li>Head injuries</li><li>Parkinson’s Disease</li><li>Multiple Sclerosis</li><li>Ataxia</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p>During the initial consultation, the therapist will assess your condition and help create your goals. These goals can include walking, returning to sport, driving, or returning to work.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Your <strong>Neuro Female Physiotherapist in Noida </strong>can help in improving movement, strength, coordination, and balance. The therapies help in stimulating the CNS through a wide range of activities. The therapist can also help improve your confidence levels, as there is emphasis on improving your quality of life. You can lead a healthier and better life with the help of the right therapist. If you are a female, you can now find a therapist from the same gender if that makes you feel comfortable.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (25, 'what-are-the-causes-of-back-pain-in-children', 'What are the Causes of Back Pain in Children?', 'There are increased instances of back pain in children, especially due to new changes in lifestyle. Children are much less likely to suffer from back pain than adults. Yet there has been a surge in the numbers in recent times. If your child is suffering from this type of pain, your doctor may also p', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="576" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/cause-of-back-pain-in-child-blog.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="What are the Causes of Back Pain in Children" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/cause-of-back-pain-in-child-blog.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/cause-of-back-pain-in-child-blog-300x176.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/11/cause-of-back-pain-in-child-blog-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>There are increased instances of back pain in children, especially due to new changes in lifestyle. Children are much less likely to suffer from back pain than adults. Yet there has been a surge in the numbers in recent times. If your child is suffering from this type of pain, your doctor may also prescribe <strong><a href="../../paediatric-physiotherapy.html">physiotherapy for child in Noida</a></strong>. Find out the common underlying causes of this pain and when your child may need therapy.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Causes of Back Pain in Kids</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Most children will have back pain without any serious underlying condition. Studies show that in 78% of children with back pain, there is no cause. Some of the common causes and situations where <strong><a href="../../back-pain.html">physiotherapy for back pain in Noida</a></strong> may be required are as follows:</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Muscular Pain</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Muscular pain is the most common cause in kids and teens of all age groups. There are causes of muscular problems including the following:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Muscle strains</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ligament strains</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Posture problems</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Injuries due to muscle overuse</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Poor muscle conditioning</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Usually, muscular back pain can be improved with the help of rest, changes in activities, and physiotherapy. Physiotherapy can provide both short-term and long-term relief and improvement.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Problems of the Disc</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The chances of disc herniation are much lower in children, but they are also a cause of back pain. Some of the symptoms can include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li>Tingling in the legs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Weakness in the lower body</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pain in the legs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Difficulty with bending and straightening</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Numbness</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>This problem may occur in extreme cases in children because the disc is made of more elastic and flexible material in them.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Your child may also develop back pain due to stress fracture. This usually occurs in adolescents, but has also been seen in children. This may occur not because of any injury but due to stress over a period of time. If your child shows any signs of back pain, you should see a specialist and seek <strong>physiotherapy for child in Noida</strong>.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `excerpt`, `content_html`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (26, 'why-women-need-special-physiotherapy-for-certain-health-problems', 'Why Women Need Special Physiotherapy for Certain Health Problems', 'If you are a woman, you should know that there are both physiological and physical differences between men and women. So women need special physiotherapy in different conditions and at different ages. If you or a loved one are having certain physical problems, you should be careful when choosing the', '<figure class="feature-image">\n          <img width="982" height="575" src="../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/back-pain-treatment-blog.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="Why Women Need Special Physiotherapy for Certain Health Problems" decoding="async" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/back-pain-treatment-blog.jpg 982w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/back-pain-treatment-blog-300x176.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2022/06/back-pain-treatment-blog-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px">        </figure>      \n          \n    \n    <article>\n      \n<p>If you are a woman, you should know that there are both physiological and physical differences between men and women. So women need special physiotherapy in different conditions and at different ages. If you or a loved one are having certain physical problems, you should be careful when choosing the <strong>best physiotherapist in noida</strong> for women’s health.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">BasicPhysical Differences</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are thinking about looking for a <strong>Female Physiotherapist in Noida</strong>, you should know about the following physical differences between men and women:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Women have lesser muscle mass than men</li><li>Women usually have greater proportion of body fat. Most of this fat is stored in specific body parts.</li><li>Men usually have more body hair.</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Benefits of Physiotherapy for Women</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>There is lots of evidence about the benefits of physiotherapy in alleviating or curing symptoms of incontinence, pelvic pain, prolapse, constipation, and other conditions in women. Some of areas where the <strong>best physiotherapist in noida</strong> can help you include the following:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Relief from lower back pain</li><li>Activation of pelvic floor</li><li>Relief from pelvic and hip pain around pregnancy</li><li>Reduction in lymphatic swelling</li><li>Strengthening core</li><li>Control of urinary incontinence</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Treating Hypotonic Pelvic Floor Muscles</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Studies show that structured exercise regimen can strengthen the pelvic floor muscles and reverse many symptoms of hypotonic pelvic floor muscles. Some of the treatment methods used in physiotherapy include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Pelvic floor exercises for re-training</li><li>Pilates based exercises to improve pelvic stability</li><li>Use of pelvic floor muscle stimulators for improving pelvic floor contraction</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Your <strong>Female Physiotherapist in Noida</strong> can include many therapies into your treatment program. This can include trigger point release, scar massage, neural mobilizations, myofascial stretches, relaxation techniques, and more. Your therapist can also provide you advice on positional and toileting modifications depending on your health problem.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thus, there are many reasons why women’s health conditions often require a therapist who specializes in the area.</p>\n      \n           \n    </article>', '/blogs/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/cropped-logo-kr.jpeg', 1, 'Dr. Neelam Sharma', '2024-02-05 18:50:14', 'published', '2026-09-12 11:45:44', '2026-09-12 11:45:44');
